              "value": "return the below message in the {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJB_LLM_EXTRACT_OBJECT_AND_INTENT.$output.language}} language \n\nI currently support displaying invoices in various statuses based on a business unit, customer, contract name, or contract number. I can also submit a single draft standard invoice for approval or cancel a single accepted standard invoice.\n\n ### Guardails : \n- Do not respond in Json format.\n- Do not show any error code in response.\n- Keep the response crisp.\n- Do not make anything yourself and only print whatever is present in given inputs as per the rules."
